			"notes": "# Dark Caverns v1.2.0\n\n### Tweaks\n- Added missing smelting and blasting recipes for hellstone ore\n- Added storage block uncrafting recipes for platinum and luminite\n- Added composter support for all cavern plants, mushrooms, and berries\n- Added fire spread and flammability to all flora\n- Made scorchling tails usable as furnace fuel w/1600 ticks\n- Reorganized and cleaned up creative tab item order\n- Rebalanced shroomie trade prices (this fixes an infinite trade exploit)\n- Tweaked camorock drops to give carfstone ores instead of overworld stone ores\n- Buffed scorchling tail drop rates and added looting scaling\n- Added fortune enchantment scaling to hellstone ore\n- Added missing subtitles and translations\n- Reduced scorched meat saturation duration\n\n### Bugfixes\n- Fixed luminite helmet dynamic lighting lag (#8)\n- Fixed crash caused by duplicate carver blocks on world generation\n- Fixed crash when throwing corrupted pearls without an owner\n- Fixed throwable torch placement, survival checks, and item drops\n- Fixed portal teleporters not working for non-player entities\n- Fixed gateway portal cooldown synchronization\n- Fixed scorchsteel armor invisibility timer bug in multiplayer\n- Fixed a rare dedicated server crash caused\n- Fixed duplicate stone brick slab recipe conflict\n- Fixed carfstone blocks burning infinitely in vanilla dimensions\n- Fixed mob types (monster vs creature) causing bad biome mob spawns\n- Fixed missing of fire resistance to scorchsteel leggings and boots\n- Fixed music overlap with vanilla music\n\n### Compat and technical\n- Added forge tags to everything that should have it (#6)\n- Added vanilla tags for stairs, slabs, and walls\n- Added beacon base block and payment item support for platinum and hellstone\n- Added piglin interaction tags for carfstone gold ore\n- Migrated geckolib entity assets into the mods own namespace"
		}
